  "history": [],
  "facts": [
    "The Mountain Golem is not immune to knockback, and it will be knocked back 0.5 tiles, but can reset his attack animation.",
    "Log Traps are a trap available in the Clan Capital, available at Capital Hall level 4. When a ground unit moves in front of it, it unleashes a log that deals damage to all ground units in its path, and knocks back smaller troops by 1 tile, and larger troops by 0.5 tiles.",
    "The Log Trap can be rotated by angles of 90 degrees. This changesits trigger area depending on the direction it faces."
  ],
